WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.260
When a repair is waiting on a person, distinguish the work already done from the response still missing.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:12.300
In Status and Assignment, choose Awaiting Response only when that describes the actual blocker.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:20.980
Add a resolution note naming the test and who owes confirmation; verify the saved line so the next shift can act without rereading the whole thread.
